<main id="main">

<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap">
<div><h1>A global community that tests these ideas where it lives.</h1><p class="lede">RadicalxChange is made up of technologists, social scientists, artists, activists and public servants who share a mission: to modernise the basic institutions of democracy and markets through a radically egalitarian, participatory vision. There are many ways in.</p></div>
<div class="aside">Everyone in the community operates under our <a href="/community/code-of-conduct/">code of conduct</a>.</div>
</div></section>
<section class="section" id="call"><div class="wrap">
<div class="twocol">
<div><h3>The monthly community call</h3><p>First Wednesday of every month, 9am ET / 3pm CET, open to anyone. It's the fastest way to see the work up close and meet the people doing it.</p><p><a class="btn primary" href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/u/0/embed?src=c_lucq4409c3e2db9j5vld22p8to@group.calendar.google.com&amp;ctz=America/New_York">Add the call to your calendar</a></p></div>
<div><h3>Between calls</h3><p>Our <a href="/updates/#salon">Salons</a> are recorded and free, and the podcast is on <a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/1Dra7JqDbgw1eXJRk7Pq5e">Spotify</a> and <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxRk8v1Wcxa1TIKTvqrtSOw">YouTube</a>. The <a href="#newsletter">newsletter</a> goes out once a month, and we post on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/radicalxchange">LinkedIn</a>, <a href="https://twitter.com/RadxChange">Twitter</a> and <a href="https://www.instagram.com/radxchange/">Instagram</a>.</p><p>Planning an event for the community? <a href="https://forms.gle/YtQABdjoGtovPrHo6">Tell us about it</a> and we'll spread the word. Past convenings are <a href="#convenings">listed below</a>.</p></div>
</div>
</div></section>
<section class="section tint" id="chapters"><div class="wrap">
<div class="section-head"><div><h2>Chapters</h2><p>Chapters are the local hubs of the community: autonomous, driven by their own character, welcoming people of every background and level of experience. Each chapter is contactable directly through its organisers.</p></div><a class="more" href="mailto:info@radicalxchange.org?subject=Starting%20or%20joining%20a%20chapter">Find or start a chapter</a></div>
<div class="comms"><div><h3>Amsterdam, Netherlands</h3><p>Focusing on digital identity (Data Dignity, Social Identity, Self-Sovereign Identity) and decentralised trust infrastructure in the EU.</p><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Jacopo Nuti</p><p class="info">Signal: jaco.101 | Discord: jaco_101</p></details></div><div><h3>Barcelona, Spain</h3><p>We focus on facilitation and discussion dynamics between a diverse audience and speakers, we have used dynamics like fishbowl and other play-full participatory sessions, for example playing Le Grand Jeu the game. Varied participants blending web3 developers with artist and social projects with specific focus on accessibility to local community.</p><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Nikoline Arns</p><p class="info"><a href="https://discord.gg/TJCA7F2V">Discord</a> | Telegram: @nikoline_nik</p></details></div><div><h3>Berlin, Germany</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Kat Banas, Bastin Jafari</p><p class="info">Telegram: <a href="https://t.me/rxc_berlin">https://t.me/rxc_berlin</a></p></details></div><div><h3>Brussels, Belgium</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Anja Von Rosenstiel, Andreas Fauler</p><p class="info">Signal (Anja): anna_R06.36  (Andreas): XQTStrategy.42</p></details></div><div><h3>Frankfurt, Germany</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Andreas Fauler</p><p class="info">Signal: XQTStrategy.42</p></details></div><div><h3>London, England</h3><p>The RxC London community explores democratic innovation and institutional design, with a focus on connecting local policy debates to global experiments in plurality, governance, and technology. We host events and discussions that bring together researchers, practitioners, and the public around RadicalxChange ideas.</p><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Guido Sforni</p><p class="info"><a href="https://discord.gg/g8gUVSUF">Discord</a></p></details></div><div><h3>Madrid, Spain</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Malik Lakoubay</p><p class="info">Telegram: @mlakoubay | <a href="mailto:malik@radicalxchange.org">Send Malik an email</a></p></details></div><div><h3>Lisbon, Portugal</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Leon Erichsen</p><p class="info"><a href="mailto:rxclisbon@proton.me">Send Leon an email</a></p></details></div><div><h3>Milan, Italy</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Alessandro Roboni</p><p class="info">Telegram: @ilsignorwolff</p></details></div><div><h3>Zurich, Switzerland</h3><p>Slow Co-Grow | Tuning up the chapter | Encouraging signals of incoming local Zürich Radxers | Interested to expand range and reach toward the &quot;Trust Valley&quot; of Lausanne-Geneva... eventually forking to their own chapters | &amp; Buzzing around further bridging potentials between the sister regions of Ethereum and Etherlaken. | In progress: Hub activations with Plural Events, plus Plural Tech and &quot;Comms Gardening&quot; aka &quot;Wisdom Flow&quot;</p><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Charles Blass</p><p class="info">Telegram/Discord: @lovevolv | <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rolandringgenberg/">LinkedIn</a> | <a href="https://link.bar/cb">Linktree</a> | <a href="mailto:roland@rolandringgenberg.com">Send Roland an email</a> | <a href="mailto:cb@lovevolv.org">Send Charles an email</a></p></details></div><div><h3>Kiev, Ukraine</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Max Semenchuk</p><p class="info"><a href="https://discord.gg/3SvbBEnb">Discord</a></p></details></div><div><h3>Warsaw, Poland</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Discord channel</p><p class="info"><a href="https://discord.gg/rQmpjVKN">Discord</a></p></details></div><div><h3>Paris, France</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Christophe Gauthier, Yuting Jiang</p><p class="info"><a href="mailto:rxcparis@radicalxchange.org">Send Christophe an email</a> and also direct POC, TBC</p></details></div><div><h3>Mexico City, Mexico</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Discord Channel</p><p class="info"><a href="https://discord.gg/9hn5kzRe">Discord</a></p></details></div><div><h3>La Paz, Bolivia</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Beto Saavedra</p></details></div><div><h3>Buenos Aires, Argentina</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Malik</p><p class="info">Telegram: @mlakoubay | <a href="mailto:malik@radicalxchange.org">Send Malik an email</a> | <a href="https://discord.gg/32MTJGzE">Discord</a></p></details></div><div><h3>Brazil</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Discord Channel</p><p class="info"><a href="https://discord.gg/yuecy6pC">Discord</a></p></details></div><div><h3>Sydney, Australia</h3><p>We’re a growing chapter with an interest in the application of ideas from political philosophy and radical economics in real world contexts, and in how experiments in new forms of participation, decision-making and resource allocation can shift political discourse, support social movements, and expand the Overton Window for systems change.</p><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Jess Scully</p><p class="info"><a href="mailto:jess@radicalxchange.org">Send Jess an email</a> | Discord channel</p></details></div><div><h3>Auckland, New Zealand</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Discord Channel</p><p class="info"><a href="https://discord.gg/NBjdYUZB">Discord</a></p></details></div><div><h3>Tokyo, Japan</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Discord Channel</p><p class="info"><a href="https://discord.gg/y4QXe6KtHh">Discord</a></p></details></div><div><h3>Seoul, Korea</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Discord Channel</p><p class="info"><a href="https://discord.gg/JDxWvk49">Discord</a></p></details></div><div><h3>Mumbai, India</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Discord Channel</p><p class="info"><a href="https://discord.gg/fTFu7K9A">Discord</a></p></details></div><div><h3>Taipei, Taiwan</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Discord Channel</p><p class="info"><a href="https://discord.gg/mTY4Ugw3">Discord</a></p></details></div><div><h3>Boston, MA</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Discord Channel</p><p class="info">Signal (Anja): anna_R06.36 | <a href="https://discord.gg/QmJsQQxP">Discord</a></p></details></div><div><h3>Denver, CO</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Taylor Kendal</p><p class="info">Telegram: @tayken</p></details></div><div><h3>New York City, NY</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Jack</p><p class="info"><a href="mailto:jack@radicalxchange.org">Send Jack an email</a></p></details></div><div><h3>Bay Area, CA</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Matt</p><p class="info">Telegram: @mprewitt | <a href="https://discord.gg/mRcxSDv8">Discord</a></p></details></div><div><h3>LA, CA</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Discord Channel</p><p class="info"><a href="https://discord.gg/pbmxVPS4">Discord</a></p></details></div><div><h3>Montreal, Canada</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Glosso</p><p class="info">Telegram: @Glosso</p></details></div><div><h3>Toronto, Canada</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Patcon</p><p class="info">Telegram: @patcon | <a href="https://discord.gg/qdetWqAW">Discord</a></p></details></div><div><h3>Philadelphia, PA</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Discord Channel</p><p class="info"><a href="https://discord.gg/XVYCarEn">Discord</a></p></details></div><div><h3>Washington, DC</h3><details><summary>Contact</summary><p class="contact">Discord Channel</p><p class="info"><a href="https://discord.gg/ZUwzCV7C">Discord</a></p></details></div><div>